Package: ziggy
Version: 1.0
Section: python
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CodeOS Community <admin@codeos-community.org>
Depends: python3, python3-threaded-http, libqt5core5a, libqt5gui5, libqt5widgets5
Description: CodeOS AI — Ziggy backend with Jarvis integration

Ziggy is CodeOS's AI system. The brain runs as a Python backend on the dev host;
the in-kernel Qt panel is just a renderer that ships the prompt over HTTP and
prints the reply.

This package provides the Ziggy AI backend server that uses Jarvis as the AI
engine, compatible with CodeOS's kernel/ai.c HTTP transport.

.
WWW: https://github.com/CodeOS-Comunity/Ziggy
